    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the energy law, in relation to the composition, responsibilities and discretion of the state energy planning board and making technical changes related thereto",
    "basePrintNo": "S3914",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3914-2011",
    "coSponsors": {
